{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C header file", "description": "This file contains utility functions for manipulating network packets, including extracting and inserting various byte-length data types from/to network streams, handling endianness, and avoiding unaligned memory access. It defines inline functions to facilitate byte-oriented operations on network packets, typically used in network protocol implementations related to IEEE 1905.1/1a stack.", "external_files": ["platform.h"], "external_methods": [], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "void _E1B(uint8_t ** packet_ppointer,uint8_t * memory_pointer)", "description": "Extracts a single byte from the network packet stream and advances the packet pointer.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _I1B(const uint8_t * memory_pointer,uint8_t ** packet_ppointer)", "description": "Inserts a single byte into the network packet stream from memory.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _E2B(uint8_t ** packet_ppointer,uint16_t * memory_pointer)", "description": "Extracts two bytes from the network packet stream, handling endianness, and advances the packet pointer.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _I2B(const uint16_t * memory_pointer,uint8_t ** packet_ppointer)", "description": "Inserts two bytes into the network packet stream from memory, handling endianness.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _E3B(uint8_t ** packet_ppointer,uint32_t * memory_pointer)", "description": "Extracts three bytes from the network packet stream, handling endianness.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _I3B(const uint32_t * memory_pointer,uint8_t ** packet_ppointer)", "description": "Inserts three bytes into the network packet stream from memory, handling endianness.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void _E4B(uint8_t ** packet_ppointer,uint32_t * memory_pointer)", "description": "Extracts four bytes from the network packet stream, handling endianness.", "sc